-/* -- The frame the approved composition is pinned to -- */
-/* The stage is the whole canvas. It used to be a scaled 1440 frame centred in
-   the canvas, which is what pulled the type block to mid-canvas and left a dead
-   left third: the frame shrank away from both margins at once. The block now
