-     Type block  columns 1-6   left edge on the left margin
-     Gutter      column 7      the composition's breathing space
-     Window      columns 8-12  right edge on the right margin
-
-     The gutter is column 7 rather than column 6 because five columns cannot
-     hold the arrest: at 1440 five columns are 552.7px and the arrest's first
-     line costs 631px at 100px (measured 6.305x its font size at opsz 100).
-     Five columns top out at 567px before gutters at any width, so cols 1-5 is
