-       Raising the group by 16u puts the window's centre on the band's centre,
-       which is where the copy column's INK centre already sits: pixel-scanned
-       at alpha >= 64 the copy's ink midpoint measures 337.50 against a band
-       centre of 338.00 at 1966x594, and 490.50 against 491.00 at 1440x900.
-       Half a pixel high at both, inside one device pixel, deliberately not
-       corrected ΓÇö a correction below the measurement's own resolution is a
-       nudge wearing a token's name.
-
-       16 IS NOT A NEW INTERVAL: it is half of 32, and both already belong to
-       the hero's vocabulary.
-
-       RE-DERIVE IF THE WHISPER WRAPS. This is half a ONE-LINE stack. At two
-       lines the stack is 61u and this token is wrong by 14.5u. The whisper is
